   "texts": [
    "What if it cost money to have a package delivered again when you were not home at the time it arrived?",
    "Charging for redelivery means the person receiving the package pays a fee on top of the usual shipping cost.",
    "How should we decide whether to charge a fee or reduce redeliveries in another way?",
    "Let’s hear from three people with different lives and points of view."
   ]
