   "texts": [
    "Having to pay for redelivery just doesn’t sit right with me.",
    "My husband and I are both away at work, so for packages where we can choose a delivery time, we choose a day and time when we know we’ll be home.",
    "But once, I chose a morning time slot and the package didn’t come.",
    "I went out to take care of an errand, and when I got back, there was a missed-delivery notice.",
    "There are also many packages where you can’t choose a time, and you don’t know beforehand when they’ll arrive.",
    "Before charging us, I want them to first do something about arriving at the time we chose and telling us when the package will arrive.",
    "The delivery workers must have a hard time because there aren’t enough of them, and I guess it can’t be helped.",
    "But I can’t accept having to pay for that.",
    "Am I wrong to feel this way?"
   ]
  },
