   "texts": [
    "A missed-delivery notice was left at the home of someone who had chosen a morning time slot, too.",
    "For people who can choose how to receive packages, a redelivery fee can be a signal that encourages them to make an effort.",
    "But having the person receiving the package pay won’t change late deliveries or how arrival times are shared.",
    "The person receiving the package can’t change how much shipping costs or how much of it goes to the people who deliver the packages, either.",
    "When you couldn’t be home and had a problem, could you choose how to receive your package?",
    "Did you know when it would arrive?",
    "Is that a problem that can be changed by charging the person receiving the package?"
   ]
